OL,3,ANI secretary to ban the Drumcree parade
OL,4,
OL,5,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,6,FBryant has said he will ban the
OL,7,Fcontentious Orange Order parade at
OL,8,FDrumcree.
OL,10,FThe dispute has led to a stand-off
OL,11,Fbetween Orangemen and nationalist
OL,12,Fresidents of the Garvaghy Road in
OL,13,FPortadown lasting almost two weeks.
OL,15,FSir Chris said the chief constable
OL,16,Fadvised him "it would not be possible
OL,17,Fto enable the procession to happen
OL,18,Fwithout a major intervention which
OL,19,Fwould carry an unacceptable risk of
OL,20,Fserious injury, disorder and a wider
OL,21,Fcontagion effect across Northern
OL,22,FIreland".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
